    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A curse lay upon the town of Tombwater.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a lone gunslinger who arrives in the accursed ghost town in search of a lost friend. The residents of the once-prosperous mining town have been afflicted by madness. Monsters and horrors roam the streets and there are few souls remaining with a sound mind. If the eldritch beasts of the town can be overcome\u2013 there may be hope yet for Tombwater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood-Spilling Combat</strong><br>Dash and slash your way through combat against unsettling eldritch beasts. Utilize an arsenal of firearms, blades, spells, apothecary items, and charms to develop your own playstyle to fight against the madness. You can strike with a cavalry saber before dashing away to cast a spell, or you may prefer to equip a flame-imbued shotgun and a heavy mining pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/47f9069715beff5e5a7a865e85d55ad5.poster.avif?t=1755181240\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/47f9069715beff5e5a7a865e85d55ad5.webm?t=1755181240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/47f9069715beff5e5a7a865e85d55ad5.mp4?t=1755181240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Exploration</strong><br>Tread your way through the cursed, interconnected world of Tombwater. Metroidvania elements allow you to discover canyons, scrublands, forests, mines, and more. Find many secret, optional areas full of strange NPCs and their quests, or dangerous enemies guarding rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/bbfe11326c3f4fa22b78295e1dce5b0c.poster.avif?t=1755181240\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/bbfe11326c3f4fa22b78295e1dce5b0c.webm?t=1755181240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/bbfe11326c3f4fa22b78295e1dce5b0c.mp4?t=1755181240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eldritch Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cursed town, a mining disaster, a missing sheriff, and a darkness permeating everything. Uncover the secrets that Tombwater's inhabitants are trying to keep buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Top-Down Souls-Like:</strong> Experience a Souls-Like from a new perspective. Nostalgic, gruesomely detailed pixel art in a top-down view with every classic Souls-Like mechanic.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map &amp; Quest Log: </strong>Keep track of your progress as you explore the inter-connected Wild West world of Tombwater with a map and quest log.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apothecary Crafting: </strong>Helpful tonics, explosives and more can be crafted from materials you find while exploring to help aid you in battle\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gruesome Boss Fights: </strong>Experience 20+ horrifying boss battles that will threaten to drive you to madness.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A curse lay upon the town of Tombwater.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a lone gunslinger who arrives in the accursed ghost town in search of a lost friend. The residents of the once-prosperous mining town have been afflicted by madness. Monsters and horrors roam the streets and there are few souls remaining with a sound mind. If the eldritch beasts of the town can be overcome\u2013 there may be hope yet for Tombwater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood-Spilling Combat</strong><br>Dash and slash your way through combat against unsettling eldritch beasts. Utilize an arsenal of firearms, blades, spells, apothecary items, and charms to develop your own playstyle to fight against the madness. You can strike with a cavalry saber before dashing away to cast a spell, or you may prefer to equip a flame-imbued shotgun and a heavy mining pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/47f9069715beff5e5a7a865e85d55ad5.poster.avif?t=1755181240\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/47f9069715beff5e5a7a865e85d55ad5.webm?t=1755181240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/47f9069715beff5e5a7a865e85d55ad5.mp4?t=1755181240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Exploration</strong><br>Tread your way through the cursed, interconnected world of Tombwater. Metroidvania elements allow you to discover canyons, scrublands, forests, mines, and more. Find many secret, optional areas full of strange NPCs and their quests, or dangerous enemies guarding rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/bbfe11326c3f4fa22b78295e1dce5b0c.poster.avif?t=1755181240\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/bbfe11326c3f4fa22b78295e1dce5b0c.webm?t=1755181240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308200/extras/bbfe11326c3f4fa22b78295e1dce5b0c.mp4?t=1755181240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eldritch Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cursed town, a mining disaster, a missing sheriff, and a darkness permeating everything. Uncover the secrets that Tombwater's inhabitants are trying to keep buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D Top-Down Souls-Like:</strong> Experience a Souls-Like from a new perspective. Nostalgic, gruesomely detailed pixel art in a top-down view with every classic Souls-Like mechanic.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map &amp; Quest Log: </strong>Keep track of your progress as you explore the inter-connected Wild West world of Tombwater with a map and quest log.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apothecary Crafting: </strong>Helpful tonics, explosives and more can be crafted from materials you find while exploring to help aid you in battle\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gruesome Boss Fights: </strong>Experience 20+ horrifying boss battles that will threaten to drive you to madness.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Souls-Like Western. Explore the accursed Wild West town of Tombwater and lay bare the eldritch horrors that lie beneath. Survive blood-spilling combat in this gruesome 2D action-RPG that might just drive you to madness.",
